+---
+id: task-004-bulk-import-of-tasks
+type: task
+title: "Bulk import of tasks"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+Add the public helper `importTasks(list, text)`, exported from `src/index.ts`, for importing tasks in bulk.
+
+- `text` holds one task per line, as `title;priority;tags`; the priority may be empty (normal), tags are separated by spaces.
+- Blank lines are skipped.
+- Every valid line is added to the list; each line that cannot be added is reported, without stopping the import.
+- Returns `{ imported, rejected }`: `imported` is the count of tasks added, `rejected` lists `{ line, reason }`, `line` counting from 1.
diff --git a/src/domain/import.ts b/src/domain/import.ts
